.TH "WORKERNAVIGATOR.GLOBALPRIVACYCONTROL" "3JS" "July 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
WorkerNavigator.globalPrivacyControl \- WorkerNavigator:
globalPrivacyControl property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is only available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]WorkerNavigator.globalPrivacyControl\f[B]\f[R] read\-only
property returns the user\(cqs \c
.UR https://globalprivacycontrol.org/
Global Privacy Control
.UE \c
\ setting for the current website.
This setting indicates whether the user consents to the website or
service selling or sharing their personal information with third
parties.
.PP
The value of the property reflects that of the \f[CR]Sec\-GPC\f[R] HTTP
header.
.SH VALUE
\f[CR]true\f[R] if the user explicitly \f[I]does not\f[R] grant consent
to sell or share their data.
\f[CR]false\f[R] if the user either grants consent, or has not indicated
a preference.
.SH EXAMPLE
.IP
.EX
console.log(navigator.globalPrivacyControl);
\f[I]// \(dqtrue\(dq if the user has specifically indicated they do not want their data shared or sold, otherwise \(dqfalse\(dq.\f[R]
.EE
